*** Settings ***

Documentation
...   author: Justyna Balcerzak, Mateusz Plinta
...   contact: justyna.balcerzak@nokia.com, mateusz.plinta@nokia.com
...   description: CB008533

Library    ta5g_delta
Library    ta5g_enb
Library    ute_fsmaccess
Library    ta5g_iphy
Library    ute_wtssim
Library    ta5g_egate
Library    ta5g_testline_management
Library    ta5g_throughput
Library    ta5g_tshark
Library    ta_egate_cmd_parser

Library     taf.collectors.tcpdump       WITH NAME  tct
Library     taf.collectors.l2stream3     WITH NAME  tcl
Library     taf.collectors.core          WITH NAME  tcc
Library     taf.converters.eventdecoder  WITH NAME  tce

Library    resources/suite_specific_keywords.py
Library    resources/egate_actions.py
Library    resources/syslog_validation.py
Library    resources/tti_trace_keywords.py
Library    resources/pm_counters.py     WITH NAME  pm_counters
Resource   taf/rfrl/common_resources/robot/libraries_instances.robot
Resource   resources/keywords.robot

Force Tags      STATE_CONFIGURED    RAN_5G    CLOUD_5G_I_BOO_AP_LOO    VARIANT_SANSA_FS_ECPRI_CMWV_FDD+TDD    CIT    CDRT

Suite Setup     Run Keywords    Set Variables Based On Deployment And Release
...             AND             Configure VM interfaces
...             AND             Perform feature delta commissioning if ASIL
...             AND             Set Suite Variable    ${SUITE_SETUP_PASSED}    ${True}

Suite Teardown    Run Keywords    Run Keyword And Ignore Error    Collect Admin Api Logs    subdir=${SUITE_NAME}
...               AND             Run Keyword And Ignore Error    Collect snapshot if suite setup failed

Variables  resources/variables.py

